# The chip and the kind of binary in the keys of the GPU entries
# (D397, D214): `mdir emit --stage=lowered` for
# the device's architecture stores every PTX and cubin; for another
# architecture (MDIR_GPU_ARCH) it misses every one of both; as PTX
# (MDIR_GPU_BINARY=ptx) every PTX misses and no cubin is made; for the
# device again everything hits (Inputs/compile_cache_run.py).
#
# REQUIRES: cuda
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/compile_cache_run.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide %t target mdir | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: device: new ptx [[P:[1-9][0-9]*]] cubin [[C:[1-9][0-9]*]]
# CHECK-NEXT: other-chip: new ptx [[P]] cubin [[C]]
# CHECK-NEXT: as-ptx: new ptx [[P]] cubin 0
# CHECK-NEXT: device-again: new ptx 0 cubin 0
